sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Customer
  participant App as Customer app
  participant ST as Cloud Storage
  participant FS as Cloud Firestore
  participant CF as Cloud Functions
  participant EP as Expo Push
  actor A as Artisan
  C->>App: Choose a service, describe the problem, add photos, confirm location
  App->>ST: Upload compressed photos
  App->>FS: Create requests/id with status PENDING
  FS-)CF: onRequestCreated
  CF->>FS: Count the customer's open requests
  alt more than the limit (default 10)
    CF->>FS: Cancel with TOO_MANY_OPEN
  else within the limit
    CF->>FS: Query artisan profiles of the category and their users
    CF->>CF: Keep verified, available, inside working hours, within 2 km
    CF->>FS: Save dispatch radius and deadline, add notifiedArtisanIds
    CF->>FS: Write a newJob notification for each artisan
    CF->>EP: Push "new request near you"
    EP-->>A: Notification
  end
  loop every minute (dispatchTick)
    CF->>FS: No offer yet: widen the radius by 2 km every 2 minutes, up to 12 km
    CF->>FS: Still PENDING after 30 minutes: CANCELLED with NO_OFFERS or EXPIRED
  end
